### Open this file in Rider/VS Code and run the requests directly (the "play"
### icon next to each request). The tool manages cookies automatically -
### after login, /me etc. work as well.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness (no sign-in required)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Sign in (seed admin from appsettings.Development.json)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fahrschule.local",
  "password": "Fahrschule-Start1"
}

### Who am I?
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Set an own password (mandatory after the first sign-in)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Fahrschule-Start1",
  "newPassword": "MeinNeuesPasswort1"
}

### Refresh the token pair
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh

### Sign out
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
